---
// Real 404 page (GitHub Pages and Cloudflare Pages both serve /404.html).
// Bilingual on purpose: we cannot know which edition the visitor came from.
import '../styles/global.css'
import { href } from '../data/site'
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN" dir="ltr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <title>找不到页面 · Page not found · 一起玩 Web3 · Let’s Play Web3</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href={href('favicon.svg')} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">跳到正文</a>
    <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="article prose">
          <h1>找不到这个页面</h1>
          <p>链接可能写错了，或者这一章还没有写。你可以：</p>
          <ul>
            <li><a href={href('zh/')}>回到中文版首页</a></li>
            <li><a href={href('zh/chapters/01-how-to-read/')}>从第 1 章开始读</a></li>
            <li><a href={href('zh/search/')}>搜索全书</a></li>
          </ul>
          <section lang="en" aria-labelledby="en-404">
            <h2 id="en-404">Page not found</h2>
            <p>The link may be mistyped, or that chapter has not been written yet. You can:</p>
            <ul>
              <li><a href={href('en/')}>Go to the English home page</a></li>
              <li><a href={href('en/chapters/01-how-to-read/')}>Start with Chapter 1</a></li>
              <li><a href={href('en/search/')}>Search the book</a></li>
            </ul>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
